{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/ai/guided-resume","title":"Guided resume","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"guided-resume","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Guided resume"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Resume a recorded debug session in the live app: an AI reads what the person"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"did up to an event, brings a fresh tab to the same state, hands the tab back"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for what only the person can do (signing in), then freezes the point so it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reopens later without the AI. First choose the intent: a functional resume uses"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the current server, while a behavioral test uses recorded responses to reach"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the point and named mock cases for later Craft HTTP calls."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" a recording shows a bug in the middle of a long path and you"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"want to investigate from that exact point, either against current server data"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or in an isolated behavioral test."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Not when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" you only want to watch it again — the replay in the debug session"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dashboard does that without touching a server."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-the-person-does","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What the person does"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In the debug session dashboard, on an event of the replay: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reprendre ici"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The replay stays open. The dashboard opens a fresh application tab on the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"recorded route, marks it with an immutable request id and copies a prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"naming the exact session, event, request and tab—even when a checkpoint or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"recipe already exists."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Paste the prompt into the agent conversation. The agent reads the recording"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and asks what you want to observe there. Answer in that conversation for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"now; the dedicated app tab has a read-only "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Messages de l’agent"}]},{"t":"text","text":" panel for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"progress, instructions, blockers and completion, so you can follow the run"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"without switching back. The AI also shows an « À vous » banner when it needs"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the person, with the field highlighted."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reprise"}]},{"t":"text","text":" tab of the dashboard shows progress, saved recipes and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"their latest runs. A recipe’s detail page also lists the recorded sessions"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"started from that recipe; those sessions carry an "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Issue d’une recette"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tag in the sessions list."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"install","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Install"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The app opts in, in development only:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideCraftGuidedResume,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideCraftGuidedResumeChat,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"providers"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"meta"},{"text":".env.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"DEV"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"provideCraftDevTools","kind":"function"},{"text":"(),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"provideCraftGuidedResume","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ logServerUrl: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'http://127.0.0.1:4319'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"provideCraftGuidedResumeChat","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ logServerUrl: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'http://127.0.0.1:4319'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ]","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" []),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"];","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The repo's "},{"t":"code","text":".mcp.json"},{"t":"text","text":" declares the two MCP servers the AI host needs:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-logs"},{"t":"text","text":" (reading the archive) and "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-registry"},{"t":"text","text":" (driving the tab),"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"built from the repo on start. "},{"t":"code","text":"LOG_SERVER_URL"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"REGISTRY_BRIDGE_PORT"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"override their defaults. Several AI sessions can run them at once: the first"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"registry server holds the bridge port, the next ones relay to it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The skill "},{"t":"code","text":".agents/skills/craft-ts-guided-resume"},{"t":"text","text":" gives the AI the method, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the prompt "},{"t":"code","text":"reprise-guidee"},{"t":"text","text":" of the logs MCP says the same:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"run "},{"t":"code","text":"resume.doctor({ requestId })"},{"t":"text","text":" to select the marked app tab, then read"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"resume.request({ requestId })"},{"t":"text","text":" and the point without acting in the app;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"ask the person what they want to observe"}]},{"t":"text","text":" in the active agent"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"conversation, proposing what must be exact and whether the server can be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"written; use only questions the conversation has not already answered;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"restore a valid point, or execute its recipe, before starting a guided"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"resume;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"check the data the goal depends on, then use Craft state/methods first,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"page"},{"t":"text","text":" with named controls when the interface is part of the scenario;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"pass the same "},{"t":"code","text":"requestId"},{"t":"text","text":" to "},{"t":"code","text":"session.*"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"app.*"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"resume.say"},{"t":"text","text":"; never"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"replace it with a “latest” request. Hand sign-ins back, saying where;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"save a replayable recipe with expectations and cleanup, then freeze a point"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that records the goal, with probes that prove it holds."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"tools","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tools"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Tool"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Server"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Role"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"resume.request"}],[{"t":"text","text":"log-mcp"}],[{"t":"text","text":"read the exact request id copied from "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reprendre ici"}]},{"t":"text","text":", or the latest as a fallback"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"resume.say"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"resume.replies"}],[{"t":"text","text":"log-mcp"}],[{"t":"text","text":"write progress, instructions, hand-offs and completion to the thread shown in the dashboard and app tab; keep the goal interview and answers in the agent conversation"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"session.story"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"session.target"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"session.prerequisites"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"session.recordedCall"}],[{"t":"text","text":"log-mcp"}],[{"t":"text","text":"inspect the exact request's history, state, identity, entities, probes and calls"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"resume.doctor"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"check the log server and bridge, and select the app tab marked with this request id"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"app.launch"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"app.diff"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"reload the tab on the recorded state; compare it with the point"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"app.replay"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"invoke a recorded gesture with arguments adapted to live data"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"app.handoff"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"« À vous » banner, highlighted field, wait for a condition on the live state"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"app.writes"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"writes made since the resume started, allowed or held"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"checkpoint.save"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"list"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"restore"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"validate"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"cleanup"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"freeze, find, reopen, check and clean up a resume point"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"recipe.save"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.run"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.repair"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"save a deterministic path, execute it in the tab, or repair it from a failed step"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"recipe.network"}],[{"t":"text","text":"registry"}],[{"t":"text","text":"activate a recipe's functional or mocked HTTP mode after restoring its linked checkpoint"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"recipe.list"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.get"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.exportPlaywright"}],[{"t":"text","text":"logs"}],[{"t":"text","text":"list and read recipes stored with the session archive, or export an exploratory Playwright scaffold"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"safety","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Safety"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Secrets stay with the person."}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"page"},{"t":"text","text":" never shows the value of a password,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"one-time code or payment field ("},{"t":"code","text":"type=\"password\""},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"autocomplete"},{"t":"text","text":", or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"data-craft-sensitive"},{"t":"text","text":") and refuses to fill it. Recorded tokens are masked"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"[REDACTED]"},{"t":"text","text":" in state, "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ref:…"},{"t":"text","text":" in calls), so a recorded session"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"never opens as such: the AI hands the sign-in back and waits for the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"condition "},{"t":"code","text":"session.prerequisites"},{"t":"text","text":" gives ("},{"t":"code","text":"signedInWhen"},{"t":"text","text":", a real token)."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Write barrier."}]},{"t":"text","text":" Once launched, the tab holds writes ("},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"XMLHttpRequest"},{"t":"text","text":" with a body) to another origin than its own or loopback,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and journals the others; a server function named like a read is counted,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not listed."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Mocked behavior."}]},{"t":"text","text":" A recipe can name decoded success values, typed Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exceptions and transport failures for Craft server functions. Every run must"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"select one case per function, either through "},{"t":"code","text":"mockChoices"},{"t":"text","text":" or a saved"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"defaultCaseId"},{"t":"text","text":". An unconfigured Craft call fails closed. Non-Craft app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" and XHR requests are blocked while this mode is active; the local log"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server stays available for recipe progress. The selection is active in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"current tab until another recipe mode is activated or the tab reloads."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Resume points stay local."}]},{"t":"text","text":" They hold a test session's storage, tokens"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"included, under "},{"t":"code","text":"<DEBUG_SESSION_DIR>/checkpoints"},{"t":"text","text":", out of git. Probes only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reach the app's own origin."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Recipes stay local."}]},{"t":"text","text":" Recipe definitions and execution journals live under"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"<DEBUG_SESSION_DIR>/recipes"},{"t":"text","text":", out of git. The server rejects credential"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fields; recipe inputs use live state references for tokens and hand-off steps"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for anything the person must enter."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Where a resume may run is left to each project: the tools refuse no origin."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"resume-points","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Resume points"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"session.prerequisites"},{"t":"text","text":" proposes a probe: the recorded read that sent the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"session token (a « who am I » when there is one), with the live token. A point"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"whose session expired then fails instead of passing a bare page load."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A point records the goal the person gave, the live state (primitives, persisted storage, origin"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"storage), the origin it was taken on, an expiry chosen by the AI with its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reason, probes, what the resume created and how to delete it, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"deviations accepted. Probe strings may read the live state:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"method\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"POST\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"url\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"/api/server-functions\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"body\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"ecommerce.auth.me\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"input\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"token\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"{{state service:session / query:signInProcess token}}\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"expect\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"status\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"200","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"match\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"admin\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"] }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"{{state <address> <path>}}"},{"t":"text","text":" takes an ordinal-free primitive address and a dot"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"path ("},{"t":"code","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" for the whole value). A string that is only a placeholder takes the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"value itself."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"resume-recipes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Resume recipes"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A recipe binds its session and event to an objective interview and a sequence"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of typed steps. The tab runner supports "},{"t":"code","text":"handoff"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"create"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"ensure"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"goto"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"invoke"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"act"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"expect"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"checkpoint"},{"t":"text","text":". Conditions are read from Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state or the current route; methods and server function calls are awaited, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"condition checks have a per-step time limit. "},{"t":"code","text":"act"},{"t":"text","text":" uses named page controls;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"passwords, OTPs and similarly marked controls still require a human hand-off."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An "},{"t":"code","text":"expect"},{"t":"text","text":" is "},{"t":"code","text":"essential"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"accessory"},{"t":"text","text":". The runner applies its declared"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"remedy when one exists, records accessory deviations, and stops on an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"unrecoverable essential failure. It then removes created data using cleanup"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"calls and leaves the run failed at its step for "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.repair"},{"t":"text","text":". Supervised"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"runs return after each step with a run id. A successful final checkpoint"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"records the producing recipe id. If that point later fails its probes, the app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"starts its linked recipe. "},{"t":"code","text":"resume.request"},{"t":"text","text":" includes the latest failed recipe"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"run so the AI can repair it from the failing step. The Playwright export is a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reviewable scaffold: human hand-offs and Craft-specific operations are marked"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"as TODOs for a test-specific implementation."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a repeatable resume, the recipe is the script and the checkpoint is only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the temporary fast path. A typical flow opens "},{"t":"code","text":"/connexion"},{"t":"text","text":", waits at a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"handoff"},{"t":"text","text":" until "},{"t":"code","text":"session.prerequisites.session.signedInWhen"},{"t":"text","text":" becomes true, then"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"continues through named actions and state expectations. The runner waits five"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"minutes for a human step by default (up to fifteen minutes when configured)."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"After the recipe reaches the target, its checkpoint is linked to the recipe:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reopens use the snapshot while its expiry and probes pass; when they no longer"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pass, the app starts the linked recipe, which prepares the page and asks for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"sign-in again if needed."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"recipe.save"},{"t":"text","text":" exposes typed steps so an agent can build the sequence from the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"live registry and "},{"t":"code","text":"session.prerequisites"},{"t":"text","text":". Give every recipe a short,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"recognizable "},{"t":"code","text":"name"},{"t":"text","text":" and a one-sentence "},{"t":"code","text":"summary"},{"t":"text","text":" for the dashboard; keep"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"objective.goal"},{"t":"text","text":" as the precise behavior to reproduce. The example below shows"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the human boundary; replace the session, origin, state address, route, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"probe with values read from the current app. Empty objective lists,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"mayWrite: false"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"strategy: \"autonomous\""},{"t":"text","text":", cleanup, and revision history are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the defaults."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"To make a result observable in a later dashboard run, add a "},{"t":"code","text":"handoff"},{"t":"text","text":" without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"until"},{"t":"text","text":" after the relevant screen; the person continues by confirming « C'est"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fait »."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Saving returns a server-owned "},{"t":"code","text":"draft"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"validation-failed"},{"t":"text","text":" status with any"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"static issues. It cannot mark a recipe verified. Use the dashboard action to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"open a fresh application tab for prevalidation. The recipe becomes "},{"t":"code","text":"verified"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"only after every essential expectation passes, its unconditioned observation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"handoff is reached, and "},{"t":"code","text":"app.writes"},{"t":"text","text":" is empty when "},{"t":"code","text":"objective.mayWrite"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"false"},{"t":"text","text":". The dashboard shows the latest status and failed step/error; repair"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the recipe from that step without weakening essential expectations."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"For a behavioral test, add "},{"t":"code","text":"network: { mode: \"mocked\", mocks: [...] }"},{"t":"text","text":" with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"one entry per server-function id or Craft HTTP endpoint and its named cases."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Use the exact "},{"t":"code","text":"METHOD URL"},{"t":"text","text":" graph identity for a "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftHttpClient"},{"t":"text","text":" call, such"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"as "},{"t":"code","text":"POST /api/cart"},{"t":"text","text":". Leave out"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"defaultCaseId"},{"t":"text","text":" to choose on every run; set it to remember a case. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.network"},{"t":"text","text":" activation applies that profile after a valid checkpoint has"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"been restored, without replaying the recipe's setup steps. The log server"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requires at least one success and one failure case per mocked call; exception"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cases preserve their Craft discriminant. The success "},{"t":"code","text":"response"},{"t":"text","text":" is the value"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the app's server-function client receives (often a JSON string in this repo)."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"For stateful scenarios, a success case may include "},{"t":"code","text":"nextChoices"},{"t":"text","text":", mapping other"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"call ids to case ids. The current response is returned first; those cases apply"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to subsequent calls. For example, a successful delete can switch the next"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"ecommerce.admin.overview"},{"t":"text","text":" response to a dataset without the deleted product."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"A fresh "},{"t":"code","text":"recipe.run"},{"t":"text","text":" starts from the saved defaults again, so it can re-arm the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"initial dataset."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"When the person should do the deletion, prepare the admin view first, pause on"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a hand-off that waits for the Donut to disappear, then add an essential"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"expectation for that same absence. The person clicks Delete in the app; the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"mocked delete response switches the following overview read to the no-Donut"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"case. Starting the recipe again uses the initial overview choice and restores"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the Donut for another run."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"To sign in against the live server and then isolate the behavior under test,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"put "},{"t":"code","text":"{ \"type\": \"network\", \"mode\": \"mocked\" }"},{"t":"text","text":" after the "},{"t":"code","text":"handoff"},{"t":"text","text":" step and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"before the tested actions. Without a "},{"t":"code","text":"network"},{"t":"text","text":" step, the recipe's mode starts"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"at the first recipe step."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"network\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"mode\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"mocked\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"mocks\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"call\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"ecommerce.cart.addLine\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"defaultCaseId\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"added\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"cases\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"added\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"kind\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"success\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"response\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"{","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\\"","kind":"string"},{"text":"id","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\\"","kind":"string"},{"text":":","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\\"","kind":"string"},{"text":"cart-1","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\\"","kind":"string"},{"text":"}\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"store-error\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"kind\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"exception\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"tag\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"StoreError\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"payload\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"code\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"STORE_ERROR\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"status\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"400","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"message\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"Cart is full\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" } },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"offline\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"kind\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"failure\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"message\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctua